{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15307280","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15307280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1530728001:1":{"text":"예전에는 그랬지요. 하지만 그분도 언제나 응답해 주시는 건 아니었어요...","source_cn":"曾经是，可是她也不总是有求必应……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0D006CB179BA1BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1530728002:1":{"text":"하지만 마법은 달라요. 배워두기만 하면 그 힘은 나의 것이 되죠.","source_cn":"但是魔法不一样，只要我学会了，那这份力量就属于我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BFD4683616744E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530728003:1":{"text":"그러면 더는 기도하지 않아도 돼요.","source_cn":"之后的我便不用再去乞求。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5272361680E9D0A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:巫祭水猫":{"text":"주술 사제 워터캣","source":"巫祭水猫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}